# Docker matches these against the context root only unless they start with **/,
# and this is a pnpm workspace: nine nested node_modules trees (lib/*, artifacts/*,
# scripts) would otherwise be copied in as dangling symlink farms, because the root
# node_modules/.pnpm store they point into is itself ignored.
**/node_modules
.pnpm-store
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.git
.gitignore
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
mlflow.db
mlartifacts
**/dist
tmp
out-tsc
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# 31 MB of official statute prints live in data/statutes. They are the user's
# verification sources, not runtime inputs — ingest reads the .json files.
**/*.pdf

.env
.env.local
.vscode
.idea
